  "returns": "\n\n        <p>A dictionary mapping message IDs to dictionaries describing the messages\n        (as returned by <a href='https://usosapps.vistula.edu.pl/developers/api/services/mailclient/#message'>message</a> method).\n        If specified message could not be found, <b>null</b> is returned instead of a\n        dictionary.</p>\n    ",
